1355
00:55:08,795 --> 00:55:10,395
It looks small, doesn't it?

1356
00:55:11,465 --> 00:55:14,365
It might feel too heavy if you use it as a blanket.

1357
00:55:14,435 --> 00:55:15,834
So if you use it as a sheet,

1358
00:55:15,835 --> 00:55:17,934
it's really warm...

1359
00:55:17,935 --> 00:55:19,365
