1360
00:55:19,435 --> 00:55:20,465
It's perfect.

1361
00:55:20,705 --> 00:55:21,735
It's nice.

1362
00:55:22,475 --> 00:55:23,534
It's soft.

1363
00:55:23,535 --> 00:55:25,605
(He can't stop touching it.)

1364
00:55:26,005 --> 00:55:28,314
