1376
00:55:53,305 --> 00:55:54,335
Bring it on.

1377
00:55:54,835 --> 00:55:57,505
(A match between a 55-year-old and a 58-year-old)

1378
00:55:58,005 --> 00:56:00,745
(Never looked so happy today)

1379
00:56:02,275 --> 00:56:04,985
(While the secretaries are having a good time...)

1380
00:56:08,985 --> 00:56:12,825
