1383
00:56:17,195 --> 00:56:18,565
(My Star continues hosting.)

1384
00:56:19,065 --> 00:56:20,195
Show me your bayonet skills.

1385
00:56:21,765 --> 00:56:24,665
(Suddenly turning into the bayonet instructor)

1386
00:56:25,205 --> 00:56:27,805
(The sergeant first class' sharp moves)

1387
00:56:27,935 --> 00:56:30,175
(Happy to see his older bestie's talent)

1388
00:56:30,905 --> 00:56:31,974
Take this.

1389
00:56:31,975 --> 00:56:34,075
(While they're having a good time...)

1390
00:56:34,345 --> 00:56:35,544
Okay.

1391
00:56:35,545 --> 00:56:38,345
(My Star is irritated.)

1392
00:56:38,685 --> 00:56:42,715
I had to...

1393
00:56:42,985 --> 00:56:45,925
