1394
00:56:46,025 --> 00:56:47,754
And they kept getting on my nerves.

1395
00:56:47,755 --> 00:56:49,355
(They kept getting on my nerves.)

1396
00:56:49,625 --> 00:56:50,655
It's slippery.

1397
00:56:51,195 --> 00:56:53,064
- It's slippery. - Exactly.

1398
00:56:53,065 --> 00:56:54,195
(The secretaries are taking their time to check out the gallery.)

1399
00:56:55,865 --> 00:56:58,605
(They look like...)

1400
00:56:59,505 --> 00:57:02,775
