1401
00:57:03,605 --> 00:57:04,704
Look at that.

1402
00:57:04,705 --> 00:57:06,805
(Honey, look at that.)

1403
00:57:08,415 --> 00:57:11,184
(The old lady who is still young at heart takes a picture.)

1404
00:57:11,185 --> 00:57:13,985
(My husband's back)

1405
00:57:15,185 --> 00:57:18,384
(The old man is serious about cleaning.)

1406
00:57:18,385 --> 00:57:22,195
(The old lady likes cats.)

1407
00:57:22,395 --> 00:57:26,725
(They make a perfect couple.)

1408
00:57:26,765 --> 00:57:29,064
They look after each other so much.

1409
00:57:29,065 --> 00:57:31,505
(They look after each other so much.)

1410
00:57:31,565 --> 00:57:32,605
They look after each other...

1411
00:57:32,735 --> 00:57:35,375
more than they look after me.

1412
00:57:36,505 --> 00:57:37,575
Okay.

1413
00:57:38,205 --> 00:57:40,874
- Thank you. - Thank you.

1414
00:57:40,875 --> 00:57:43,175
- It's over. - Thank you for your time.

1415
00:57:43,775 --> 00:57:44,984
That was fast.

1416
00:57:44,985 --> 00:57:46,015
(Rushing to greet My Star)

1417
00:57:46,785 --> 00:57:47,885
Come here.

1418
00:57:48,555 --> 00:57:50,255
- Me? - Do you...

1419
00:57:51,015 --> 00:57:53,184
