1420
00:57:53,185 --> 00:57:54,384
- To join you? - Yes.

1421
00:57:54,385 --> 00:57:55,655
Can I?

1422
00:57:55,695 --> 00:57:57,254
Stay for lunch. Don't go yet.

1423
00:57:57,255 --> 00:57:58,564
- Yes, join us for the meal. - Yes.

1424
00:57:58,565 --> 00:57:59,765
Right.

1425
00:58:00,195 --> 00:58:01,964
- She's also from my agency. - Yes.

1426
00:58:01,965 --> 00:58:03,865
- It's the same agency. - Yes.

1427
00:58:04,095 --> 00:58:06,705
Let's go together in one car.

1428
00:58:07,135 --> 00:58:08,474
Gosh.

1429
00:58:08,475 --> 00:58:09,874
- Gosh. - Let's go.

1430
00:58:09,875 --> 00:58:11,474
- Well done. - Thank you.

1431
00:58:11,475 --> 00:58:12,605
(6pm, mini tour by secretaries with Jang Ye Won)

1432
00:58:14,275 --> 00:58:15,974
This is nice.

1433
00:58:15,975 --> 00:58:18,514
This place is really nice.

1434
00:58:18,515 --> 00:58:19,544
(Mini tour by secretaries for My Star)

1435
00:58:19,545 --> 00:58:20,744
Look at the sea.

1436
00:58:20,745 --> 00:58:22,515
(Excited already)

1437
00:58:23,385 --> 00:58:25,285
Ye Won, where did you first meet Kwang Kyu?

1438
00:58:25,425 --> 00:58:26,624
Where did we first meet?

1439
00:58:26,625 --> 00:58:28,955
- I don't know. - We met a lot on the way.

1440
00:58:29,325 --> 00:58:31,195
I remember sitting next to you in a wedding.

1441
00:58:32,025 --> 00:58:34,125
- Whose wedding? - Who was it?

1442
00:58:34,595 --> 00:58:35,764
Right. Was it Kangnam?

1443
00:58:35,765 --> 00:58:37,634
I think it was Kangnam's wedding.

1444
00:58:37,635 --> 00:58:40,035
I got the bouquet, right?

1445
00:58:40,635 --> 00:58:42,705
- You're all linked. - Yes.

1446
00:58:43,035 --> 00:58:44,974
Is this your first time meeting Seo Jin?

1447
00:58:44,975 --> 00:58:46,905
Please drop the honorifics.

1448
00:58:47,405 --> 00:58:48,545
- But... - Feel free.

1449
00:58:49,115 --> 00:58:50,615
It's my first time seeing him in my whole life.

1450
00:58:50,675 --> 00:58:51,745
- Really? - Yes.

1451
00:58:51,815 --> 00:58:53,884
- We didn't have a chance. - We didn't have a chance.

1452
00:58:53,885 --> 00:58:55,855
(Meeting Lee Seo Jin for the first time in her life)

1453
00:58:55,915 --> 00:58:58,325
Who found the restaurant?

1454
00:58:58,885 --> 00:59:00,324
They found it.

1455
00:59:00,325 --> 00:59:03,125
I asked them for a mini tour.

1456
00:59:03,255 --> 00:59:07,025
Because it's been a while since I last visited Gangneung.

1457
00:59:07,765 --> 00:59:09,364
Something to see,

1458
00:59:09,365 --> 00:59:10,535
watch,

1459
00:59:10,795 --> 00:59:12,535
and enjoy.

1460
00:59:12,905 --> 00:59:15,305
I asked them for those things. That's what we're going to do.

1461
00:59:15,705 --> 00:59:17,134
Yes. So...

1462
00:59:17,135 --> 00:59:18,804
