Seo Jin doesn't hold back.

1886
01:15:47,295 --> 01:15:48,935
He's got it easy.

1887
01:15:50,065 --> 01:15:52,364
(Easygoing because he's got it easy)

1888
01:15:52,365 --> 01:15:55,035
You're right. Seo Jin is a cold thinker,

1889
01:15:55,505 --> 01:15:57,035
