1891
01:15:59,705 --> 01:16:00,804
(Cold Thinker Seo Jin)

1892
01:16:00,805 --> 01:16:02,214
- A hot thinker? - A warm thinker.

1893
01:16:02,215 --> 01:16:04,115
- A warm thinker. - I'm a warm thinker.

1894
01:16:05,715 --> 01:16:07,285
