1901
01:16:18,155 --> 01:16:19,224
Nice.

1902
01:16:19,225 --> 01:16:20,765
The ocean is right in front.

1903
01:16:21,595 --> 01:16:23,194
- Hi. - Hi.

1904
01:16:23,195 --> 01:16:24,934
- Hi. - Hi.

1905
01:16:24,935 --> 01:16:26,564
- Hi. - Hi.

1906
01:16:26,565 --> 01:16:27,764
- Hi. - Hi.

1907
01:16:27,765 --> 01:16:28,864
(Showing off those dimples)

1908
01:16:28,865 --> 01:16:30,605
It's so nice to see you.

1909
01:16:30,935 --> 01:16:33,044
- You haven't visited in forever. - No, I haven't.

1910
01:16:33,045 --> 01:16:34,444
You must be the owner of this place.

1911
01:16:34,445 --> 01:16:35,675
Yes.

1912
