1915
01:16:41,085 --> 01:16:42,184
(Seo Jin is here as a secretary today.)

1916
01:16:42,185 --> 01:16:45,315
(Looking around)

1917
01:16:45,485 --> 01:16:46,855
I haven't been here for years.

1918
01:16:48,525 --> 01:16:49,894
Are you lost in memories?

1919
01:16:49,895 --> 01:16:51,794
I'm just amazed this place is still open.

1920
01:16:51,795 --> 01:16:52,924
(Full of memories)

1921
01:16:52,925 --> 01:16:55,194
Why are you tearing up? Is it bringing back memories?

1922
01:16:55,195 --> 01:16:57,395
He's crying. Seo Jin is crying.

1923
01:16:59,205 --> 01:17:00,664
Great work today.

1924
01:17:00,665 --> 01:17:01,834
Great work.

1925
01:17:01,835 --> 01:17:03,734
- Great work. - Great work.

1926
01:17:03,735 --> 01:17:05,074
- Great work. - Gosh.

1927
01:17:05,075 --> 01:17:06,275
Grouchy 1 and 2.

1928
01:17:07,905 --> 01:17:11,144
