1929
01:17:11,145 --> 01:17:14,245
Gosh, these plastic gloves...

1930
01:17:14,845 --> 01:17:15,885
are huge.

1931
01:17:17,255 --> 01:17:19,684
- They're in size large. - Yes.

1932
01:17:19,685 --> 01:17:21,754
They're large and fit well.

1933
01:17:21,755 --> 01:17:22,924
(The Giant Boy is happy about small things.)

1934
01:17:22,925 --> 01:17:24,395
- The gloves fit perfectly. - They do.

1935
01:17:24,925 --> 01:17:28,194
- Thank you. - Thank you. What a big feast.

1936
01:17:28,195 --> 01:17:29,195
What a generous feast.

1937
01:17:29,196 --> 01:17:30,735
- They all look fresh. - My gosh.

1938
01:17:31,465 --> 01:17:32,664
I love snow crabs.

1939
01:17:32,665 --> 01:17:34,664
For real, today...

1940
01:17:34,665 --> 01:17:36,975
- Yes, it's your first meal. - Since morning...

1941
01:17:37,135 --> 01:17:39,475
You saw it. This is my first meal.

1942
01:17:39,545 --> 01:17:40,605
Have some of this.

1943
01:17:40,775 --> 01:17:42,074
The abalone is delicious.

1944
01:17:42,075 --> 01:17:43,214
